    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445070/extras/dc1d9fb7f1b18f5399fab80ca94d68c2.poster.avif?t=1751139946\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445070/extras/dc1d9fb7f1b18f5399fab80ca94d68c2.webm?t=1751139946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445070/extras/dc1d9fb7f1b18f5399fab80ca94d68c2.mp4?t=1751139946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Headshot Roulette </strong>is a crazy, adrenaline-pumping roulette simulator for daredevils with a shotgun. Blanks or a fatal shot? Luck decides fate, and the result is a spectacular brain-blowing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is up to 4 players at one table. Challenge the cunning AI or play with friends live. Atmospheric room, flickering lamp light, ominous shadows - the tension increases with each move!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique items</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445070/extras/5f497a4c051999a95011b914d5b61502.poster.avif?t=1751139946\" width=796 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445070/extras/5f497a4c051999a95011b914d5b61502.webm?t=1751139946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445070/extras/5f497a4c051999a95011b914d5b61502.mp4?t=1751139946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use all methods to change the outcome of the round.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Voice chat and gestures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445070/extras/88f66549e9a38694c28009f171690a51.poster.avif?t=1751139946\" width=798 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445070/extras/88f66549e9a38694c28009f171690a51.webm?t=1751139946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445070/extras/88f66549e9a38694c28009f171690a51.mp4?t=1751139946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Discuss a plan of action or try to intimidate your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character customization</strong> - choose images that will add charisma to your hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shotgun of fate</strong> - who will take the whole bank, and who will leave with a bullet in the skull?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Headshot Roulette</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445070/extras/5083f4f2ca36666bd8a904104e92a866.poster.avif?t=1751139946\" width=798 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445070/extras/5083f4f2ca36666bd8a904104e92a866.webm?t=1751139946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445070/extras/5083f4f2ca36666bd8a904104e92a866.mp4?t=1751139946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Luck and nerves of steel are important here. Manage to outsmart the others! Are you ready to take a risk?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445070/extras/dc1d9fb7f1b18f5399fab80ca94d68c2.poster.avif?t=1751139946\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445070/extras/dc1d9fb7f1b18f5399fab80ca94d68c2.webm?t=1751139946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445070/extras/dc1d9fb7f1b18f5399fab80ca94d68c2.mp4?t=1751139946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Headshot Roulette </strong>is a crazy, adrenaline-pumping roulette simulator for daredevils with a shotgun. Blanks or a fatal shot? Luck decides fate, and the result is a spectacular brain-blowing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is up to 4 players at one table. Challenge the cunning AI or play with friends live. Atmospheric room, flickering lamp light, ominous shadows - the tension increases with each move!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique items</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445070/extras/5f497a4c051999a95011b914d5b61502.poster.avif?t=1751139946\" width=796 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445070/extras/5f497a4c051999a95011b914d5b61502.webm?t=1751139946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445070/extras/5f497a4c051999a95011b914d5b61502.mp4?t=1751139946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use all methods to change the outcome of the round.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Voice chat and gestures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445070/extras/88f66549e9a38694c28009f171690a51.poster.avif?t=1751139946\" width=798 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445070/extras/88f66549e9a38694c28009f171690a51.webm?t=1751139946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445070/extras/88f66549e9a38694c28009f171690a51.mp4?t=1751139946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Discuss a plan of action or try to intimidate your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character customization</strong> - choose images that will add charisma to your hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shotgun of fate</strong> - who will take the whole bank, and who will leave with a bullet in the skull?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Headshot Roulette</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445070/extras/5083f4f2ca36666bd8a904104e92a866.poster.avif?t=1751139946\" width=798 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445070/extras/5083f4f2ca36666bd8a904104e92a866.webm?t=1751139946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445070/extras/5083f4f2ca36666bd8a904104e92a866.mp4?t=1751139946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Luck and nerves of steel are important here. Manage to outsmart the others! Are you ready to take a risk?</p>",
